{#-
  A trial newsletter sent as Let's Do Digital, for checking that sending
  under that name works before a real one goes out. It says what it is,
  so nobody who receives it by mistake is left wondering.

  A campaign's brand is the folder it is in: this one is in `ldd/`, so it
  is drawn in the Let's Do Digital theme and sent under that name.
-#}
{% extends "newsletter.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}A trial newsletter from Let's Do Digital{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}Sent to check that newsletters, and unsubscribing from them, work.{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
{{ c.heading("A *trial* newsletter") }}
{{ c.paragraph("This is a test, sent to check that newsletters from Let's Do Digital arrive and look right. There is no news in it.") }}
{{ c.paragraph("If you were not expecting it, you can ignore it. The unsubscribe link below works, and so does the button your mailbox may show at the top.") }}
{% endblock %}
{% block text %}
A trial newsletter

This is a test, sent to check that newsletters from Let's Do Digital arrive and look right. There is no news in it.

If you were not expecting it, you can ignore it.

Unsubscribe: {{ unsubscribe_url }}

Mark Bailey, Bailey Medics
{% endblock %}
